{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月27日，長城汽車董事長魏建軍近日在接受採訪時談及公司銷量排名變化。他表示，儘管長城汽車目前排在第九位，但自己「心裏很坦然」，並稱一些競爭者反而「睡不着覺」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588192.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.666857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:34:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"397b4210d6710de1d31a60058d4ea82375f961333db26d04ecbf05483006e72c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}